---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — ToolSite">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>Use of This Site</h2>
    <p>ToolSite provides free utility tools for personal and professional use. By using this site, you agree to use it lawfully and not to attempt to disrupt, reverse-engineer, or misuse the service.</p>

    <h2>No Warranty</h2>
    <p>Tools are provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. While we aim for accuracy, we do not guarantee that results from any tool (calculations, conversions, generated data) are error-free, and you should verify critical results independently.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>ToolSite is not liable for any damages or losses resulting from the use of, or inability to use, this website or its tools.</p>

    <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these Terms can be sent via our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>